  "overview": "**Arbetsformedlingen Design System** is a light-first design system anchored on `#fefefe` canvas surfaces with `#0b0b0c` primary ink (19.5:1 contrast) and `#1db920` brand accent.\n\nTypography centers cleanly on `Open Sans` (40px display down to 16px body), unified by `8px` base corner radius and stepped `#fefefe` -> `#F1F7E5` surface layering.\n\nMaintained by **Arbetsformedlingen**. Source: published token package (https://designsystem.arbetsformedlingen.se/), package `@designsystem-se/af`. Inventory: **91** colors, **40** typography steps, and **8** documented components (Apache-2.0 license).\n\n### Layout & Spacing\n- **Grid & Control Spacing**: Derived from 8 component tokens with documented paddings: `8px 12px`, `2px`, `6px 12px`, `12px 14px`, `10px 14px`.\n- **Hierarchy**: Group controls cleanly within `#F1F7E5` cards; separate sibling sections using `#d5d5d5` hairlines rather than oversized whitespace.\n\n### Elevation & Depth\n- **Surface & Stroke Elevation**: Relies on crisp tonal contrast (`#fefefe` -> `#F1F7E5`) and `1px solid #d5d5d5` hairlines instead of heavy drop shadows.\n- **Interactive Lift**: Reserve higher surface brightness or focus outlines anchored on `#1db920` for keyboard focus and active selection states.",
  "dos": "### Do\n- Anchor base views on `#fefefe` (light) with `#0b0b0c` primary text and `#0b0b0c` secondary labels.\n- Use `#1db920` with `#0b0b0c` text (7.5:1) for primary CTAs, active tabs, and focus outlines.\n- Pair `Open Sans` headings with `Open Sans` body copy using documented weights and scale steps.\n- Apply `8px` base geometry across inputs and buttons (8px on outer containers).\n- Separate containers via `#F1F7E5` surface shifts and `#d5d5d5` hairlines cleanly.\n\n### Don't\n- Do not invert the base canvas out of light polarity without explicitly switching component text tokens.\n- Do not place low-contrast muted ink or raw white text on light accents without verifying >= 4.5:1 WCAG AA contrast.\n- Do not invent arbitrary brand colors, unverified fonts, or synthetic heavy shadows outside the palette above.\n- Do not mix conflicting corner radii that clash with the system's `8px` baseline.\n- Do not truncate or drop border contrast on `input` fields and secondary buttons."
}
